25 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. October to November is the driest pair at 5.19 inches normal, and in 2025 it got 34% of normal on the middle of the grids, with September to October at 20% that same year. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, from 58% on grid 13392 to 66% on grid 13694.</p>"}
